            {
                "entry_id": "0961b781-0e9c-385e-91f7-06a3d6659a23",
                "word": "Ninja",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "c1985a9f-983d-4874-84ca-0770d395de91",
                        "entry_id": "0961b781-0e9c-385e-91f7-06a3d6659a23",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "Ninjas"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "98053fb9-2c9b-3819-ada6-dfd4ff49ccc0",
                        "entry_id": "0961b781-0e9c-385e-91f7-06a3d6659a23",
                        "glosses": [
                            "An anti-government Bakongo rebel, active in Pool Department, Republic of the Congo (Congo-Brazzaville)."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "1160afe0-9ed8-411c-81d9-7c062b1e182d",
                                "sense_id": "98053fb9-2c9b-3819-ada6-dfd4ff49ccc0",
                                "text": "To punish a population seen as Ninja sympathisers, the government last year effectively sealed off the entire region and barred all aid, turning Pool into a blank space on the humanitarian map."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "6d72e2b8-eb8b-4a3c-9d14-f6699c48df90",
                                "sense_id": "98053fb9-2c9b-3819-ada6-dfd4ff49ccc0",
                                "text": "While the last major clashes were in 2003 in Pool — a southern region between the capital Brazzaville and the port city of Pointe Noire — Ninjas had continued to roam the region, robbing civilians and hijacking trains to the oil-rich coast."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "45427b54-1246-4913-b287-6fa3588a03ec",
                                "sense_id": "98053fb9-2c9b-3819-ada6-dfd4ff49ccc0",
                                "text": "The Ninjas were loyal to former Prime Minister Bernard Kolelas, the father of Guy-Brice Parfait Kolelas, who stood in the presidential election in March and got 15% of the vote."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [],
                "word_linkages": []
            },
